{
 "name": "critic P14/P19 r1 — a child mashing Enter through real battles",
 "steps": [
  {
   "waitFor": "window.__DQ && __DQ.ready",
   "timeout": 30000
  },
  {
   "note": "1. The very first fight of the game: Long Lane, Lv1, Papa + Bobble. Mash Enter only."
  },
  {
   "eval": "(() => { __DQ.assist(0); return __DQ.battle('long_lane', {level: 1, seed: 3}); })()"
  },
  {
   "waitFor": "__DQ.idle() && __DQ.state().ui.menu && __DQ.state().ui.menu.kind==='command'",
   "timeout": 15000
  },
  {
   "shot": "01-first-fight-command"
  },
  {
   "press": "Enter",
   "times": 6,
   "delay": 350
  },
  {
   "wait": 900
  },
  {
   "shot": "02-first-fight-mid"
  },
  {
   "press": "Enter",
   "times": 14,
   "delay": 350
  },
  {
   "wait": 1500
  },
  {
   "shot": "03-first-fight-end"
  },
  {
   "eval": "JSON.stringify({phase: __DQ.state().battle.phase, round: __DQ.state().battle.turn, party: __DQ.state().party, res: __DQ.state().snapshot.result && {exp: __DQ.state().snapshot.result.exp, levelUps: __DQ.state().snapshot.result.levelUps}})"
  },
  {
   "note": "2. Second and third fights, same seed stream, still Lv1 — look for the first level-up."
  },
  {
   "eval": "__DQ.battle('long_lane', {level: 1, seed: 8, enemies: ['gloop','gloop','peckish']})"
  },
  {
   "waitFor": "__DQ.idle() && __DQ.state().ui.menu && __DQ.state().ui.menu.kind==='command'",
   "timeout": 15000
  },
  {
   "press": "Enter",
   "times": 24,
   "delay": 320
  },
  {
   "wait": 2500
  },
  {
   "shot": "04-long-lane-fight2-end"
  },
  {
   "note": "3. Bram alone at Lv1 against two Gloops (what the rules do with no Papa)."
  },
  {
   "eval": "__DQ.battle('long_lane_alone', {level: 1, seed: 21, enemies: ['gloop','gloop']})"
  },
  {
   "waitFor": "__DQ.idle() && __DQ.state().ui.menu && __DQ.state().ui.menu.kind==='command'",
   "timeout": 15000
  },
  {
   "press": "Enter",
   "times": 30,
   "delay": 330
  },
  {
   "wait": 2500
  },
  {
   "shot": "05-alone-lv1-two-gloops"
  },
  {
   "note": "4. Sogglemarsh, mid level: the typical Act II fight."
  },
  {
   "eval": "(() => { __DQ.level(1); return __DQ.battle('sogglemarsh', {seed: 44}); })()"
  },
  {
   "waitFor": "__DQ.idle() && __DQ.state().ui.menu && __DQ.state().ui.menu.kind==='command'",
   "timeout": 15000
  },
  {
   "shot": "06-sogglemarsh-open"
  },
  {
   "press": "f"
  },
  {
   "wait": 6000
  },
  {
   "shot": "07-sogglemarsh-after-fight"
  },
  {
   "note": "5. Frittering Sands, three Dune Buggies, Lv11, press F (Fight!) every round."
  },
  {
   "eval": "__DQ.battle('frittering_sands', {level: 11, seed: 5, enemies: ['dune_buggy','dune_buggy','dune_buggy']})"
  },
  {
   "waitFor": "__DQ.idle() && __DQ.state().ui.menu && __DQ.state().ui.menu.kind==='command'",
   "timeout": 15000
  },
  {
   "press": "f"
  },
  {
   "wait": 5000
  },
  {
   "shot": "08-dune-buggies-r1"
  },
  {
   "press": "f"
  },
  {
   "wait": 5000
  },
  {
   "press": "f"
  },
  {
   "wait": 5000
  },
  {
   "shot": "09-dune-buggies-r3"
  },
  {
   "eval": "(() => { __DQ.instant(true); __DQ.autoplay(60, 'auto'); __DQ.instant(false); return __DQ.state().battle.phase; })()"
  },
  {
   "wait": 800
  },
  {
   "shot": "10-dune-buggies-end"
  },
  {
   "note": "6. First boss, Mumbleroot, at its level, mashing Enter."
  },
  {
   "eval": "__DQ.battle('cobwell_manor', {boss: true, seed: 17})"
  },
  {
   "waitFor": "__DQ.idle() && __DQ.state().ui.menu",
   "timeout": 15000
  },
  {
   "shot": "11-mumbleroot-open"
  },
  {
   "press": "Enter",
   "times": 40,
   "delay": 300
  },
  {
   "wait": 2000
  },
  {
   "shot": "12-mumbleroot-mid"
  },
  {
   "press": "Enter",
   "times": 60,
   "delay": 300
  },
  {
   "wait": 2500
  },
  {
   "shot": "13-mumbleroot-later"
  },
  {
   "eval": "JSON.stringify({phase: __DQ.state().battle.phase, turn: __DQ.state().battle.turn, party: __DQ.state().party, boss: __DQ.state().battle.enemies})"
  },
  {
   "note": "7. Sunmane and Bogwallop at their levels — are they dramatic?"
  },
  {
   "eval": "__DQ.battle('sogglemarsh', {boss: true, seed: 2})"
  },
  {
   "waitFor": "__DQ.idle() && __DQ.state().ui.menu",
   "timeout": 15000
  },
  {
   "press": "f"
  },
  {
   "wait": 6000
  },
  {
   "press": "f"
  },
  {
   "wait": 6000
  },
  {
   "shot": "14-bogwallop-after-2-rounds"
  },
  {
   "note": "8. Mortmain with a child who only presses Attack (and the rubber band maxed)."
  },
  {
   "eval": "(() => { __DQ.assist(100); return __DQ.battle('quiet_deep', {boss: true, seed: 9}); })()"
  },
  {
   "waitFor": "__DQ.idle() && __DQ.state().ui.menu",
   "timeout": 15000
  },
  {
   "eval": "(() => { __DQ.instant(true); __DQ.autoplay(99, 'mash'); __DQ.instant(false); return JSON.stringify({phase: __DQ.state().battle.phase, turn: __DQ.state().battle.turn, boss: __DQ.state().battle.enemies}); })()"
  },
  {
   "wait": 900
  },
  {
   "shot": "15-mortmain-mash-S100"
  },
  {
   "note": "9. A monster asking to join in a natural Sogglemarsh walk."
  },
  {
   "eval": "(() => { __DQ.assist(0); for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) { __DQ.instant(true); __DQ.battle('sogglemarsh', {seed: 300 + i}); __DQ.autoplay(99, 'auto'); const r = __DQ.state().snapshot.result; if (r && r.recruit && r.recruit.offer) { __DQ.instant(false); return 'offer on fight ' + (i + 1); } } __DQ.instant(false); return 'no offer in 12'; })()"
  },
  {
   "wait": 900
  },
  {
   "shot": "16-recruit"
  },
  {
   "assert": "__DQ.errors.length===0 && __DQ.state().errors===0",
   "msg": "no runtime errors"
  }
 ]
}